\ [> … | is optional sugar for [: |> … | — a minimalist lambda syntax opening a
\ receive-all quotation. The spelled-out forms [: |> … | (receive-all) and
\ [: | >x scratch | (selective receive plus scratch slots) are the general
\ openers. All equivalent to [:.
[ 2 3 4 ] [> x | x x f* :] map . cr
[ 2 3 4 ] [: | >x | x x f* :] map . cr
[ 2 3 4 ] [: |> x | x x f* :] map . cr
3.0 [> a | a a f* :] execute . cr
